      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "It seemed with the sale pitch that all was going to go well.But from day one all went bad.The installers had no details of where on the roof the system was to go & had other work that they had to attend.Instead of a day or two to install the system it took weeks .Had to keep contacting Phazer to find out what was going on.Very poor communication would not call back & the tradesman had to chase them to get a reply back.They had damaged my roof & left it with Tek screw holes for water to come leaking inside while they were gone for a number of daysIf not for me checking their work and fixing the holes, this would have been a serious problem.Other issues also arose that should not have that we had discussed prior starting.They wanted more money to pay for optimisers to add to our existing system to make it work with the new 5kw system.This was already discussed in the price for the Contract.Recently our system went down & Phazer would not return calls for two days. We had to get other parties to fix it. Do NOT use this company.",
